# OpenJoan formatting: LLVM base, 120 columns (the width joan-re's code already uses). Applied per file as it is
# curated (CLAUDE.md section 8), never to generated files (src/original/gen, src/data, *_names.hpp, *.inc).
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Standard: c++20
ColumnLimit: 120
IndentWidth: 4
AccessModifierOffset: -4
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: WithoutElse
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
PointerAlignment: Left
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
SortIncludes: CaseSensitive
